BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sensory Discovery Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260728T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260728T150000
UID:a1864ebe7f3208e0072f8379a6691ca0@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nJoin Ms. Laura for a fun and engaging 
 sensory discovery storytime program all about ICE CREAM! We will use our s
 enses to explore how ice cream looks\, feels\, smells and...TASTES!!! This
  program is intended for children 3-6 years old. Children should be able t
 o listen to\, comprehend and participate in emergent science\, math and li
 teracy topics. Activities may include small parts so children should be pa
 st the stage of mouthing items. Parents and caregivers are invited to part
 icipate with their children to learn how to replicate the activities at ho
 me! Sensory experiences provide children with opportunities to develop fin
 e motor skills\, eye-hand coordination\, problem solving\, logic and conce
 ntration. They'll grow their attention spans and practice emotional regula
 tion and mindfulness.Allergy notice: Please note sensory materials may con
 tain allergens like milk.Ms. Laura has over 20 years of preschool classroo
 m experience bringing a wealth of knowledge in early childhood development
 . Her approach focuses on creating a warm\, engaging\, and supportive envi
 ronment where children can thrive.Adults attending with their child(ren) d
 o NOT need to register. Please add any additional registrants to your regi
 stration if more than one child that will be participating in the program.
 Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 15th for Manheim Town
 ship and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, July 17th for residents o
 f other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to ca
 ncel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will b
 e restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one mont
 h’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the
  start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notifie
 d of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 1
 0 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other
  circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At
  this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who wil
 l be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the 
 program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 
 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for 
 adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engage
 d with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please c
 heck your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been
  cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/sensory-discovery-storyt
 ime-182738
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
