BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Birds and Reptiles: Living Dinosaurs by Lancaster County Parks
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T140000
UID:de8ecf58f166f4225babd4484d8a3bd3@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nDinosaurs may be
  a thing of the past\, but there are still living dinos all around us! Lea
 rn about the ancient “terrible lizards” and their modern-day relatives
 : birds and reptiles. We will bring bird and reptile specimens for partici
 pants to feel and if time and space allow\, we will go outside to look for
  living\, tweeting dinos.Registration for Birds and Reptiles: Living Dinos
 aurs by Lancaster County Parks will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 29t
 h for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, Augu
 st 5th for residents of other municipalities.Registration Requirements:  P
 lease register ONLY the children who will be attending.   Cancellations- P
 lease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has n
 ot been cancelled. Library Program Policies  No Show – Patrons failing
  to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month 
 will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of on
 e month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior 
 to the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notif
 ied of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arr
 ive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking 
 and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated
  time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait lis
 t who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed 
 into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter
  the program 5 minutes past the start time. Accompanying Adults – This
  program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to atte
 nd and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted. Photog
 raphy - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibi
 ts photographing or video recording individuals (including children) witho
 ut their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or g
 uardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/birds-and-reptiles-livin
 g-dinosaurs-lancaster-county-parks-170766
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
