BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wills\, Trusts & Retirement Planning (Tues Afternoon Class)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T150000
UID:ca452fcd511a953e5070be7aed0c6770@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Discussion\, Finance\, Health & Wellness\, Presentation\, Adul
 ts\, Seniors\n\nSecuring Your Legacy: A Wills\, Trusts & Retirement Worksh
 opThinking about the future can be overwhelming\, but estate planning does
 n’t have to be a mystery. Join us for an interactive workshop led by loc
 al expert Mr. William Fetzer. Whether you are just starting to plan or loo
 king to protect what you’ve built\, this session will break down the ess
 ential steps to securing your legacy and ensuring your peace of mind.What 
 we'll cover:Wills vs. Trusts: Understanding the critical differences and f
 inding the right fit for your family.Asset Protection: Safeguarding your h
 ard-earned savings from unexpected costs.Retirement Readiness: Smart strat
 egies to maximize your income and ensure your nest egg lasts.Don't leave y
 our family’s future to guesswork. Bring your questions and leave with a 
 clear roadmap.
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/wills-trusts-retirement-
 planning-tues-afternoon-class-191383
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
