 eim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, August 7th for re
 sidents of other municipalities.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel th
 eir registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restr
 icted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s t
 ime. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start 
 of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notified of their 
