 s prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other cir
 cumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At thi
 s time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be
  granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the prog
 ram. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 
 5 minutes past the start time. Drop Off Program – This program is inte
 nded for children over the age of 13 years who can participate independent
 ly. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services staff p
 rior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.  Designa
 ted Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your re
