DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nStorytime for Ages 3-5Reading to young
  children is an important part of early child development and preparation 
 for school. In Library Storytime\, children are introduced to weekly theme
 s and concept through books\, rhymes\, songs\, and puppets. We also practi
 ce     important Preschool skills like taking turns\, being active listene
 rs\, and learning to be part of in a group. **PLEASE be sure to include yo
 ur email address on the registration. If you do not\, you WILL NOT receive
  registration confirmation or notification if the event is cancelled.  We 
 are unable to send you that information if you only include a phone number
 . -Thank You!
