 d\; walk-ins will be accommodated as space allows. Best for adults and old
 er interested teens.We welcome local immigration attorney Paige Britton\, 
 who will share her professional experience working within the U.S. immigra
 tion system to offer curious patrons a clearer understanding of the law as
  it regards "legal" and "illegal" immigrants. This session will offer time
  for questions afterward. Please note that this program is meant to provid
 e non-partisan information and the presenter is not able to provide counse
 l or advice regarding any individual situations.
