DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (For
  safety reasons\, children must not be younger than 18 months or older tha
 n 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is required)Adults attendi
 ng with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additiona
 l registrants to your registration if more than one child that will be par
 ticipating in the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 September 30th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Fri
 day\, October 2nd for residents of other municipalities.Storytime Policies
 No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 l
 ibrary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future 
 programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrati
 ons at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those 
 on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.
 Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progr
 am to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pr
 omptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited 
 to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, reg
 istrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not b
 e permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanyin
 g Adults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Pl
 ease plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be 
 permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to ver
 ify that the program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are l
 imited to one session of multiple session programs per week.
